If a patient receives a long-term-opioid-therapy and a clinician prescribes an initial-opioid-prescription for the patient then the clinician should review a state-PDMP-record before the initial-opioid-prescription for the patient.
If a clinician manages a patient during a long-term-opioid-therapy and the patient has a state-PDMP-record and the clinician does not review the state-PDMP-record during 3 months then the clinician should review the state-PDMP-record for the patient.
